brief_summary:
This study includes three groups of Drug-Drug Interaction( DDI ) studies:

1. To evaluate the effect of verapamil on the pharmacokinetics of a single oral dose of VC005 in healthy subjects;
2. To evaluate the effect of probenecid on the pharmacokinetics of a single oral dose of VC005 in healthy subjects;
3. To evaluate the effect of VC005 on the pharmacokinetics of a single oral dose of metformin tablets in healthy subjects.
